// What steps in a gap between rows in these tests (mbui's gaps_steady.mbt), a file at a time: how many a Tester made in
// it may show. Each only falls: a jump mended takes its file's number down, and a file at 0 leaves the list.

///|
fn init {
  @ui.gaps_steady_known([
    ("src/sfapp_pages_test/station_peek_test.mbt", 1),
  ])
}
